          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The
            %strong tube lemma
            may refer to one of several fundamental lemmas in topology (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/general+topology"} point-set topology
            to be more exact
            %sup#fnref:1>
              %a{:href => "#fn:1", :rel => "footnote"} 1
            ) that underlie many arguments involving
